OL,3,GNEWSAContractor sought as former Odeon
OL,4,Aplans approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to replace a former Odeon cinema
OL,7,Fin Kent with a new arts centre have
OL,8,Fbeen given the final sign off.
OL,10,FCouncillors are hopeful the new
OL,11,Ffacility in Ashford will be open by
OL,12,Fmid-2028, and a contractor for the
OL,13,Fproject is being sought.
OL,15,FA proposal to turn the landmark
OL,16,Fbuilding into a new arts, culture and
OL,17,Fcommunity centre was approved by the
OL,18,Fborough council's cabinet on 8 October,
OL,19,Fand its planning committee earlier this
OL,20,Fweek.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
