OL,3,GNEWSAContractor sought as former Odeon
OL,4,Aplans approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FHailing a "major milestone", Noel
OL,7,FOvenden, leader of Ashford Borough
OL,8,FCouncil, said: "There is still work to
OL,9,Fdo before the curtain rises, but we are
OL,10,Fmoving forward with a clear ambition."
